{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/727690/extras/fb7c97fd075864c30a5a2da531180f19.poster.avif?t=1769841137\" width=594 height=334 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/727690/extras/fb7c97fd075864c30a5a2da531180f19.webm?t=1769841137\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/727690/extras/fb7c97fd075864c30a5a2da531180f19.mp4?t=1769841137\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >PAIN-TO-WIN is a top-down horror shooter set in a total asylum that will never happen, a closed, conspiratorial environment shaped by death cults, paranoia, and fragmented hierarchies. You play as an organ extractor, earning money by bounty hunting madmen, psychos, and other violent degenerates. The game draws from ugly, uncomfortable PSX-era maniac aesthetics through handcrafted, highly detailed non-pixel art visuals.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/727690/extras/a855144ef93ec8c3488f5c6ea6f09901.poster.avif?t=1769841137\" width=250 height=248 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/727690/extras/a855144ef93ec8c3488f5c6ea6f09901.webm?t=1769841137\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/727690/extras/a855144ef93ec8c3488f5c6ea6f09901.mp4?t=1769841137\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A system built on violence, organ trade, and routine brutality. Inmates, dealers, and contractors operate as parts of the same mechanism.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Fragmented non-linear world structure. Wandering, detours, dead ends. Some paths loop back. Others lead nowhere. Nothing guides forward.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Hostile combat. The environment degrades alongside the subject. Rooms fill with debris, blood, and bodies. Clarity is not guaranteed.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Interactions with NPCs: inmates, cultists, dealers, and other human waste. Talk, trade, ignore, or kill.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Each weapon has its own way to harm.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Perks and upgrades come from extraction, trade, and brain surgery.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><picture><source srcset=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/727690/extras/8d2ea9b3fa9cebe4a052291b650f8e39.webp?t=1769841137\"><img src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/727690/extras/8d2ea9b3fa9cebe4a052291b650f8e39.poster.avif?t=1769841137\" class=\"bb_img\" width=600 height=120 /></picture></span></p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/727690?t=1769841137","background_raw":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/727690/page_bg_raw.jpg?t=1769841137","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/727690/2d1de65a0f2213d0f9824de6eafe339ef5a187bd/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1769841137","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/727690/2d1de65a0f2213d0f9824de6eafe339ef5a187bd/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1769841137","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Multi-player","id":1},{"description":"Co-op","id":9},{"description":"Shared/Split Screen Co-op","id":39},{"description":"Shared/Split Screen","id":24},{"description":"Full controller support","id":28},{"description":"Remote Play Together","id":44},{"description":"Family Sharing","id":62}],"content_des