tality. Inmates, dealers, and contractors operate as parts of the same mechanism.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Fragmented non-linear world structure. Wandering, detours, dead ends. Some paths loop back. Others lead nowhere. Nothing guides forward.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Hostile combat. The environment degrades alongside the subject. Rooms fill with debris, blood, and bodies. Clarity is not guaranteed.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Interactions with NPCs: inmates, cultists, dealers, and other human waste. Talk, trade, ignore, or kill.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Each weapon has its own way to harm.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Perks and upgrades come from extraction, trade, and brain surgery.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><picture><source srcset=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/727690/extras/8d2ea9b3fa9cebe4a052291b650f8e39.webp?t=1769841137\"><img src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/727690/extras/8d2ea9b3fa9cebe4a052291b650f8e39.poster.avif?t=1769841137\" class=\"bb_img\" width=600 height=120 /></picture></span></p>","developers":["pain2.win"],"genres":[{"description":"Action","id":"1"},{"description":"Adventure","id":"25"},{"description":"Indie","id":"23"}],"header_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/727690/336ad5bc4140571d9c795bca1a67c15562139d9d/header.jpg?t=1769841137","is_free":false,"linux_requirements":[],"mac_requirements":[],"movies":[{"dash_av1":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/727690/1685328485/5e25b29a2378c30dc820e6c1c1491bdf01a90d37/1756848805/dash_av1.mpd?t=1756991446","dash_h264":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/727690/1685328485/5e25b29a2378c30dc820e6c1c1491bdf01a90d37/1756848805/dash_h264.mpd?t=1756991446","highlight":true,"hls_h264":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/727690/1685328485/5e25b